                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 13. It is understood by both parties that the provisions of this Article are consistent with the Family and Medical Leave Act of 1993, USC Section 2601 et seq. and that leave granted in accordance with Sections 1 and 12, shall be designated as leave under the provisions of the Act.",
