        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 1. The position classification plan, as established and maintained by the Employer, consists of a schedule of classification titles with classification specifications for each classification which define and describe representative duties and responsibilities and set forth the minimum requirements and qualifications essential to the work of the classification. Only in those instances where there is a substantial change in permanent job duties or job content during the term of this Agreement which justifies a change in job classification or where a claim of a longstanding misclassification exists may the employees process an appeal for a reallocation of their position through the grievance procedure as set forth below:",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                902,
                1084,
                1122
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    902.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    902.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    1122.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    1122.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "STEP I. The employee shall present the grievance in writing to the head of the employee's institution, community health district or agency central office unit or their designee. For grievances seeking the reallocation of a position, the employee shall attach to the grievance a description of the job. Grievances under Section 4 below shall be filed within 15 working days of the occurrence of the action giving rise to the grievance or knowledge of its occurrence.",
            "block_bbox": [
                210,
                1145,
                1084,
                1285
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    210.0,
                    1145.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    1145.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    1285.0
                ],
                [
                    210.0,
                    1285.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The institutional or local management designee shall attempt to resolve the matter and report a decision to the Local Union Representative and/or the employee within 15 working days.",
